{
  "observed_defect": "Silhouettes lack sculptural mass, terrain seams show unnatural ring-shaped craters, foliage lacks grounded LOD roots, and height falloff creates visual voids around POIs.",
  "design_intent": "Introduce compact, finite-footprint hills using Gaussian decay to preserve POI integrity, ensuring visual unity and mobile legibility without altering architecture or camera.",
  "asset_decision": "MODIFY",
  "reason_for_new_geometry": "Existing terrain creates unnatural ring-shaped craters that break visual continuity and gameplay anchors. Compact hills with controlled falloff preserve POIs while adding believable landform variation.",
